# quest-vr-webxr

> Early JavaScript WebXR work aimed at Quest-style VR in the browser.

## Purpose
Give a plain-language door to fitzyracing1/quest-vr-webxr.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the original repo as the place for WebXR files.
2. Use this clone to explain the idea.
3. Send the reader back to the source to run it.

## Key ideas
- WebXR (VR/AR in the browser)
- Quest-style target
- JavaScript source

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/quest-vr-webxr
open_source()
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. open_source() → “go to fitzyracing1/quest-vr-webxr”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader needs the scene → send them to the source

## What a person would notice
A named wrap on a browser-VR door.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the source.
